    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 2a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ to ælcere byrig ⁊ on ælcere scyre hæbbe ic mines cynescypes gerihta swa min fæder hæfde, ⁊ mine þegnas hæbben heora scipe on minum timan swa hi hæfdon on mines fæder.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And that in every borough and every county I possess my royal perogative as my father did, and that my thegns keep their rank in my lifetime as they did in my father's.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ to ælcere byrig ⁊ on ælcere scire hæbbe ic mines cynescipes gerihta, swa min fæder hæfde; ⁊ mine þegnas hæbben heora scipe on minum timan, swa hy hæfdon on mines fæder.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
